{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49028","headline":"偶宴西蜀摩诃池 · 畅甫","name":"偶宴西蜀摩诃池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍木郁清池，风荷左右披。\n浅觞宁及醉，慢舸不知移。\n荫林簟光冷，照流簪影攲。\n胡爲独羁者，雪涕向涟漪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}